You live a little sweet nerfy life, sitting on your biscuit, never having to risk it.

956
00:40:16.060 --> 00:40:20.260
And Michael is, he's just so bummed out.

957
00:40:20.560 --> 00:40:27.260
He really wanted to prove to these guys that things get just as crazy up in the office.

958
00:40:28.460 --> 00:40:30.520
It's such a weird thing to take a stand on.

959
00:40:30.620 --> 00:40:31.060
