00:42:16.900 --> 00:42:18.420
With a very tiny spoon.

1009
00:42:18.540 --> 00:42:18.660
Yeah.

1010
00:42:19.040 --> 00:42:19.620
You'd love that.

1011
00:42:19.800 --> 00:42:21.640
I like eating with tiny cutlery.

