Yes.

1016
00:42:26.860 --> 00:42:30.000
Where they make a teeny tiny meal in a teeny tiny kitchen.

1017
00:42:30.140 --> 00:42:30.360
Yes.

1018
00:42:30.560 --> 00:42:31.580
It's mesmerizing.

1019
00:42:31.880 --> 00:42:32.140
It's mesmerizing.

