1027
00:42:46.400 --> 00:42:49.980
I can't believe that you got to see the tiny kitchen in person.

1028
00:42:50.280 --> 00:42:50.820
Oh, my God.

1029
00:42:50.820 --> 00:42:51.660
It's so cool.

1030
00:42:51.840 --> 00:42:52.340
It's so cool.

1031
00:42:52.360 --> 00:42:53.360
Is it so tiny?

1032
00:42:53.380 --> 00:42:54.560
It's so tiny.

1033
