Yeah.

1286
00:54:48.140 --> 00:54:53.680
They talk about it in the commentary that they weren't getting it until take number 11.

1287
00:54:54.320 --> 00:54:57.840
Oh, Kent said it was the last watermelon, that it was take 12.

1288
00:54:58.120 --> 00:55:01.960
Oh, Harold Ramis said it was take number 11.

1289
00:55:02.760 --> 00:55:09.840
Oh, well, so guys, it was either take 11 or 12, I guess by some miracle, it landed on the

1290
00:55:09.840 --> 00:55:12.380
trampoline and it hit the car perfectly.

1291
