00:55:51.500 --> 00:55:54.160
But yes, they would have done something like this.

1308
00:55:54.160 --> 00:55:58.680
They would have thrown a watermelon off of a building onto a trampoline and tried to hit

1309
00:55:58.680 --> 00:55:59.500
