1310
00:55:59.900 --> 00:56:06.120
And Dwight and Michael's reaction just 100% reminded me of these Dude Perfect videos that

1311
00:56:06.120 --> 00:56:07.220
I've been watching with my son.

1312
00:56:07.380 --> 00:56:09.060
Yes, I have seen those videos.

1313
00:56:09.200 --> 00:56:12.400
I didn't know the guy's name or whatever they go by.

1314
00:56:12.580 --> 00:56:14.800
But yeah, our kids love that stuff.

1315
00:56:15.140 --> 00:56:19.540
It also made me think that maybe we need to collaborate with Dude Perfect on some sort of

1316
00:56:19.540 --> 00:56:20.580
a frothing thing.

1317
00:56:20.580 --> 00:56:27.320
So it's like off the tree, hit the trash can.

1318
00:56:28.300 --> 00:56:28.820
Yeah.

1319
00:56:29.320 --> 00:56:31.940
Frothing trick shots with office ladies and Dude Perfect.

1320
00:56:32.300 --> 00:56:35.140
It's a collaboration we've all been waiting for.

1321
00:56:35.340 --> 00:56:36.280
And Waffle Ball.

1322
00:56:37.600 --> 00:56:38.240
Did you?

1323
00:56:38.340 --> 00:56:39.160
