1324
00:56:39.240 --> 00:56:39.440
Waffle?

1325
00:56:39.540 --> 00:56:40.440
You said it in the middle.

1326
00:56:40.800 --> 00:56:41.580
Waffle Ball.

1327
00:56:41.720 --> 00:56:42.220
Waffle Ball.

1328
00:56:42.360 --> 00:56:43.520
You're rubbing off on me.

1329
00:56:43.700 --> 00:56:44.320
I know.

1330
00:56:44.460 --> 00:56:45.440
I love it.

1331
00:56:45.700 --> 00:56:49.680
Two things before we leave the whole watermelon off the roof moment, Jenna.

1332
00:56:50.160 --> 00:56:50.640
Okay.

1333
00:56:50.820 --> 00:56:56.340
Number one, all of these shots up here, when they look out over to the trampoline, you

