00:57:32.220 --> 00:57:35.420
He said, I had this moment where I was like, wait a second.

1346
00:57:35.420 --> 00:57:40.560
I'm on a roof with Steve Carell and Rainn Wilson and Harold Ramis.

1347
00:57:40.820 --> 00:57:42.500
We're throwing watermelons.

1348
00:57:42.820 --> 00:57:44.380
And I'm getting paid.

1349
00:57:44.860 --> 00:57:45.340
Yes.

1350
00:57:45.340 --> 00:57:46.740
I thought that was so sweet.

1351
00:57:46.960 --> 00:57:50.900
That's what made me think of the Dude Perfect thing, because I was like, these are like a

1352
00:57:50.900 --> 00:57:56.900
bunch of dudes up on a roof throwing watermelons down, just having a great time, but oh, they're

1353
00:57:56.900 --> 00:57:57.300
