1354
00:57:57.460 --> 00:57:57.680
Yeah.

1355
00:57:57.680 --> 00:57:59.600
Like that was their job that day.

1356
00:57:59.820 --> 00:58:00.720
I mean, how fun.

1357
00:58:00.960 --> 00:58:01.820
So fun.

1358
