1415
01:00:33.640 --> 01:00:34.240
Oh.

1416
01:00:34.240 --> 01:00:35.960
She's not participating, guys.

1417
01:00:36.120 --> 01:00:36.900
She's not going to gamble.

1418
01:00:37.120 --> 01:00:38.580
She's not going to bet on things.

1419
01:00:39.000 --> 01:00:39.400
No.

1420
01:00:39.580 --> 01:00:41.940
I remember I had a whole conversation with Harold about it.

1421
01:00:42.020 --> 01:00:43.740
Like, where would Angela be in the bullpen?

1422
01:00:44.060 --> 01:00:45.480
Would she be watching?

1423
01:00:45.880 --> 01:00:50.660
You know, and she's reluctantly glancing over to see what the hubbub is about, but she

1424
01:00:50.660 --> 01:00:51.620
will not participate.

1425
01:00:52.420 --> 01:00:57.180
Well, Angela is a little bit of a busybody in the sense that she likes to know the goings

1426
01:00:57.180 --> 01:00:57.460
on.

1427
01:00:57.560 --> 01:00:57.780
Mm-hmm.

1428
01:00:58.460 --> 01:01:00.860
But that doesn't mean she's participating.

1429
01:01:01.300 --> 01:01:01.480
No.

1430
01:01:01.760 --> 01:01:05.760
She needs to know just enough to judge you, but not enough to be judged.

1431
01:01:06.600 --> 01:01:07.160
Correct.

1432
01:01:08.780 --> 01:01:11.920
Well, now we get to a scene that is really fun.

1433
01:01:12.320 --> 01:01:21.100
Dwight has to enlist Andy's help in getting a bouncy castle, which means he has to momentarily

1434
01:01:21.100 --> 01:01:25.460
unshun him, which leads to a great shun, unshun bit.

1435
01:01:25.460 --> 01:01:28.540
It's actually unshun, re-shun.

1436
01:01:28.840 --> 01:01:29.660
That's what he says.

1437
01:01:30.100 --> 01:01:31.120
Un-shun, re-shun.

1438
01:01:31.340 --> 01:01:36.080
And on the commentary, they talked about this little bit, and they said that Gene and Lee

1439
