Rain doing that hand thing up and down was just Rain playing around.

1441
01:01:45.100 --> 01:01:46.120
I loved that.

1442
01:01:46.200 --> 01:01:46.560
I know.

1443
01:01:46.560 --> 01:01:47.600
It really sold it.

1444
01:01:47.900 --> 01:01:49.160
It really did.

1445
01:01:49.160 --> 01:01:54.980
This, like, weird, like, fake window thing that he was doing.

1446
01:01:55.140 --> 01:01:55.480
I know.

1447
01:01:55.760 --> 01:01:56.120
I know.

1448
01:01:56.260 --> 01:01:57.080
So childish.

1449
01:01:57.560 --> 01:01:58.000
Okay.

