1468
01:02:45.880 --> 01:02:49.380
It was kind of gross when he was like, like, yeah.

1469
01:02:49.980 --> 01:02:51.680
Well, I noticed something, Angela.

1470
01:02:51.940 --> 01:02:54.100
It was very windy in this scene.

1471
01:02:54.240 --> 01:02:55.040
Did you notice that?

1472
01:02:55.380 --> 01:02:56.160
Yeah, I did.

1473
01:02:56.880 --> 01:03:00.580
And I, their ties were, like, just whipping all around.

1474
01:03:01.000 --> 01:03:02.000
Did you see that?

1475
01:03:02.260 --> 01:03:02.340
Yeah.

1476
01:03:03.320 --> 01:03:08.320
Well, I decided to pause at 14 minutes, 30 seconds, and read the label on Steve's tie.

1477
01:03:08.540 --> 01:03:10.920
Oh, you're crazy, and I love it.

1478
01:03:11.140 --> 01:03:12.200
What'd you find?

1479
