It looks like it was a tie made by Gianfranco Ruffini, who was an Italian clothing designer.

1480
01:03:20.140 --> 01:03:20.740
Okay.

1481
01:03:20.740 --> 01:03:26.340
And the reason I became sort of obsessed with this was because I recently had a conversation

1482
01:03:26.340 --> 01:03:28.360
with Carrie Bennett, our wardrobe designer.

1483
01:03:28.580 --> 01:03:28.760
Yeah.

1484
01:03:29.300 --> 01:03:35.220
And she told me about how, when she was designing the show, she wanted every man in the office

1485
01:03:35.220 --> 01:03:38.220
to have a very specific tie story.

1486
01:03:38.880 --> 01:03:41.740
She wrote a tie story for every man.

1487
01:03:41.740 --> 01:03:48.120
And she told me that this was because, you know, when you're designing a show where there's

1488
01:03:48.120 --> 01:03:52.440
a bunch of men working in an office, it's really hard to differentiate them.

1489
01:03:52.600 --> 01:03:54.560
It's just a bunch of people in suits and ties.

1490
01:03:54.920 --> 01:03:58.620
So she told me that when she was doing the original design for the show, she got really

1491
01:03:58.620 --> 01:04:02.500
worried that all the men were going to look alike because they were all just wearing suits

1492
01:04:02.500 --> 01:04:03.960
or shirts and ties, right?

1493
01:04:04.440 --> 01:04:07.040
So by doing this tie story, this was her answer.

1494
01:04:07.040 --> 01:04:13.460
Her tie story for Michael Scott was that Michael buys all of his suits at JCPenney and they come

1495
01:04:13.460 --> 01:04:14.880
with a matching tie.

1496
01:04:15.120 --> 01:04:18.160
So he buys all his clothing as a full kit.

1497
01:04:18.520 --> 01:04:23.240
And this tie is part of a suit kit.

1498
01:04:23.920 --> 01:04:29.360
I looked it up and I think this is like Michael's designer.

1499
01:04:29.600 --> 01:04:31.240
This is Michael's stuff.

1500
01:04:31.360 --> 01:04:33.240
That's his go-to guy at JCPenney's.

1501
01:04:33.360 --> 01:04:33.840
Oh, I'm sorry.

1502
01:04:34.060 --> 01:04:36.640
Jacques Pinay, as my Aunt Brenda used to say.

1503
01:04:37.520 --> 01:04:39.920
Oh, is that how she says JCPenney?

1504
01:04:39.920 --> 01:04:42.680
Yeah, she'd be like, are we going to go to Tarjay and then Jacques Pinay?

1505
01:04:43.220 --> 01:04:44.440
I love that.

1506
01:04:44.760 --> 01:04:45.820
I love that.

1507
01:04:46.740 --> 01:04:50.560
Well, I don't think you can get these guys' suits anymore because when I was trying to

1508
01:04:50.560 --> 01:04:55.200
find them online, the only place I could find them was Etsy and eBay, people reselling

1509
01:04:55.200 --> 01:04:57.660
them if you want a Michael Scott tie.

1510
01:04:59.120 --> 01:05:06.400
Incidentally, something I thought was interesting, the tie maker's son is named Remo Rafini and he's

1511
01:05:06.400 --> 01:05:06.820
a billionaire.

1512
01:05:08.800 --> 01:05:10.140
What's Remo doing?

1513
01:05:10.400 --> 01:05:11.960
How do you get to be a billionaire?

1514
01:05:12.520 --> 01:05:18.540
He is also a fashion designer and he is the owner of this huge fashion company.

1515
01:05:18.800 --> 01:05:19.540
In Italy.

1516
01:05:19.980 --> 01:05:20.860
In Italy.

1517
01:05:21.980 --> 01:05:22.920
There you go.

1518
01:05:23.320 --> 01:05:24.240
There you go.

1519
01:05:24.780 --> 01:05:27.140
All because they were filming on a windy day.

1520
01:05:27.260 --> 01:05:28.360
I went down that rabbit hole.

1521
01:05:28.380 --> 01:05:29.120
I love that.

1522
01:05:29.260 --> 01:05:29.840
I love that.

1523
01:05:29.840 --> 01:05:32.700
I love that all the men have their tie story.

1524
01:05:32.900 --> 01:05:37.620
You certainly see that, I feel like, with Andy because he's so New England, preppy.

1525
01:05:37.900 --> 01:05:40.840
I feel like his suit looks very different from the other fellas.

1526
01:05:41.460 --> 01:05:41.900
Yeah.

1527
01:05:42.400 --> 01:05:42.920
Okay.

1528
01:05:43.600 --> 01:05:44.120
Well.

1529
01:05:44.360 --> 01:05:49.100
And we can discuss more tie stories as they become relevant in future episodes.

